": 10, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 10, "containerId": null, "originalText": "CONCEPTO                          LIBRE  GATEWAY\nsaludos y cortesias                  80        0\ngrado y curso ya en el formulario   120        0\ntemario completo de Comunicacion  1,100      352\nobjetivo pedagogico y limites       400      280\ninstrucciones de formato            300      210\nTOTAL                             2,000      842   -58%", "lineHeight": 1.25, "seed": 1, "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "angle": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "fillStyle": "solid", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "id": "t101"}, {"type": "text", "x": 2430, "y": 412, "width": 164, "height": 62.5, "strokeColor": "#3f3f46", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "text": "El 55% del ahorro sale de un\nsolo caso: ACOTABLE.\n\nLimpiar saludos aporta el\n10%: con eso no se llega.", "fontSize": 10, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 10, "containerId": null, "originalText": "El 55% del ahorro sale de un\nsolo caso: ACOTABLE.\n\nLimpiar saludos aporta el\n10%: con eso no se llega.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "seed": 1, "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "angle": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "fillStyle": "solid", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "id": "t102"}, {"type": "text", "x": 1930, "y": 528, "width": 562, "height": 12.5, "strokeColor": "#c92a2a", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "text": "P28: adjuntar el temario completo «por si acaso»   ·   P29: arrastrar toda la conversación anterior", "fontSize": 10, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 10, "containerId": null, "originalText": "P28: adjuntar el temario completo «por si acaso»   ·   P29: arrastrar toda la conversación anterior", "lineHeight": 1.25, "seed": 1, "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "angle": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "fillStyle": "solid", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "id": "t103"}, {"type": "text", "x": 1930, "y": 568, "width": 444, "height": 75.0, "strokeColor": "#3f3f46", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "text": "5. Cada dato responde tres preguntas: ¿hace falta?, ¿ya viaja por\n   otro campo?, ¿se puede acotar a un fragmento?\n\n6. De 2,000 a 842 tokens. El 58% no sale de limpiar el texto:\n   sale de no mandar el temario entero.", "fontSize": 12, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 12, "containerId": null, "originalText": "5. Cada dato responde tres preguntas: ¿hace falta?, ¿ya viaja por\n   otro campo?, ¿se puede acotar a un fragmento?\n\n6. De 2,000 a 842 tokens. El 58% no sale de limpiar el texto:\n   sale de no mandar el temario entero.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "seed": 1, "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "angle": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "fillStyle": "solid", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "id": "t104"}, {"type": "arrow", "x": 2860, "y": 320, "width": 100, "height": 80, "strokeColor": "#846358", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "roundness": {"type": 2}, "points": [[0, 0], [32.40000000000009, 62.0], [100, 80]], "lastCommittedPoint": null, "startBinding": null, "endBinding": null, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": "arrow", "seed": 1, "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "angle": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "fillStyle": "solid", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "id": "a105"}, {"type": "text", "x": 2980, "y": 296, "width": 372, "height": 31.25, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "text": "¿Ya existe esta respuesta?", "fontSize": 25, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "le