 "id": "t168"}, {"type": "text", "x": 4641, "y": 435.625, "width": 215, "height": 11.25, "strokeColor": "#3f3f46", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "text": "no se invoca; se le explica", "fontSize": 9, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 9, "containerId": null, "originalText": "no se invoca; se le explica", "lineHeight": 1.25, "seed": 1, "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "angle": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "fillStyle": "solid", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "id": "t169"}, {"type": "text", "x": 4641, "y": 448.875, "width": 215, "height": 11.25, "strokeColor": "#868e96", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "text": "a Rosa qué recortar", "fontSize": 9, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 9, "containerId": null, "originalText": "a Rosa qué recortar", "lineHeight": 1.25, "seed": 1, "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "angle": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "fillStyle": "solid", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "id": "t170"}, {"type": "text", "x": 3960, "y": 504, "width": 439, "height": 25.0, "strokeColor": "#3f3f46", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "text": "El bloqueo no es un error: es el sistema funcionando. Se recorta el contexto,\nnunca el objetivo.", "fontSize": 10, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 10, "containerId": null, "originalText": "El bloqueo no es un error: es el sistema funcionando. Se recorta el contexto,\nnunca el objetivo.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "seed": 1, "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "angle": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "fillStyle": "solid", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "id": "t171"}, {"type": "text", "x": 3960, "y": 552, "width": 411, "height": 25.0, "strokeColor": "#e8590c", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "text": "SALIDA EXCEDIDA es el caso que más se olvida: se controla el prompt y se\nignora la respuesta, que suele ser la parte cara.", "fontSize": 10, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 10, "containerId": null, "originalText": "SALIDA EXCEDIDA es el caso que más se olvida: se controla el prompt y se\nignora la respuesta, que suele ser la parte cara.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "seed": 1, "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "angle": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "fillStyle": "solid", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "id": "t172"}, {"type": "text", "x": 3960, "y": 600, "width": 237, "height": 12.5, "strokeColor": "#c92a2a", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "text": "P31: controlar solo los tokens de entrada", "fontSize": 10, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 10, "containerId": null, "originalText": "P31: controlar solo los tokens de entrada", "lineHeight": 1.25, "seed": 1, "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "angle": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "fillStyle": "solid", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "id": "t173"}, {"type": "text", "x": 3960, "y": 640, "width": 478, "height": 60.0, "strokeColor": "#3f3f46", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "text": "8. La estimación mira las dos direcciones: lo que entra y lo que sale.\n\n9. Tras un bloqueo el sistema no reintenta solo: devuelve el control\n   a Rosa.", "fontSize": 12, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 12, "containerId": null, "originalText": "8. La estimación mira las dos direcciones: lo que entra y lo que sale.\n\n9. Tras un bloqueo el sistema no reintenta solo: devuelve el control\n   a Rosa.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "see