 minuto.", "fontSize": 10, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 10, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Sin reserva de cuota, veinte solicitudes en cola rompen\nel presupuesto mensual en un minuto.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "seed": 1, "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "angle": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "fillStyle": "solid", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "id": "t202"}, {"type": "text", "x": 4700, "y": 930, "width": 377, "height": 30.0, "strokeColor": "#3f3f46", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "text": "11. Este caso no aparece si se desarrolla con Internet:\n    se descubre en la escuela, no en el laboratorio.", "fontSize": 12, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 12, "containerId": null, "originalText": "11. Este caso no aparece si se desarrolla con Internet:\n    se descubre en la escuela, no en el laboratorio.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "seed": 1, "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "angle": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "fillStyle": "solid", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "id": "t203"}, {"type": "arrow", "x": 5664, "y": 348, "width": 236, "height": 368, "strokeColor": "#846358", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "roundness": {"type": 2}, "points": [[0, 0], [37.039999999999964, 235.91999999999996], [236, 368]], "lastCommittedPoint": null, "startBinding": null, "endBinding": null, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": "arrow", "seed": 1, "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "angle": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "fillStyle": "solid", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "id": "a204"}, {"type": "text", "x": 5940, "y": 704, "width": 246, "height": 31.25, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "text": "¿Se logró el 40%?", "