acity": 100, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "fillStyle": "solid", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "id": "r216"}, {"type": "text", "x": 6374, "y": 805.625, "width": 170, "height": 17.5, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "text": "Valeria", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 14, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Valeria", "lineHeight": 1.25, "seed": 1, "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "angle": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "fillStyle": "solid", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "id": "t217"}, {"type": "text", "x": 6374, "y": 825.125, "width": 170, "height": 11.25, "strokeColor": "#3f3f46", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "text": "aprueba o no", "fontSize": 9, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 9, "containerId": null, "originalText": "aprueba o no", "lineHeight": 1.25, "seed": 1, "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "angle": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "fillStyle": "solid", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "id": "t218"}, {"type": "text", "x": 5900, "y": 892, "width": 380, "height": 50.0, "strokeColor": "#3f3f46", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "text": "reduccion = (tokens_base - tokens_gateway) / tokens_base x 100\n\nuna solicitud tipica    2,000  ->      842     -58%\n30 tareas del piloto   60,000  ->  <=36,000    meta -40%", "fontSize": 10, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 10, "containerId": null, "originalText": "reduccion = (tokens_base - tokens_gateway) / tokens_base x 100\n\nuna solicitud tipica    2,000  ->      842     -58%\n30 tareas del piloto   60,000  ->  <=36,000    meta -40%", "lineHeight": 1.25, "seed": 1, "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "angle": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "fillStyle": "solid", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "id": "t219"}, {"type": "text", "x": 5900, "y": 982, "width": 394, "height": 25.0, "strokeColor": "#3f3f46", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "text": "La línea base fija tarea, modelo y versión curricular: si cambia una,\nel 40% deja de significar algo.", "fontSize": 10, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 10, "containerId": null, "originalText": "La línea base fija tarea, modelo y versión curricular: si cambia una,\nel 40% deja de significar algo.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "seed": 1, "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "angle": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "fillStyle": "solid", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "id": "t220"}, {"type": "text", "x": 5900, "y": 1026, "width": 540, "height": 12.5, "strokeColor": "#c92a2a", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "text": "P33: medir contra una línea base no comparable   ·   P34: el prompt vive en el chat del docente", "fontSize": 10, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 10, "containerId": null, "originalText": "P33: medir contra una línea base no comparable   ·   P34: el prompt vive en el chat del docente", "lineHeight": 1.25, "seed": 1, "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "angle": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "fillStyle": "solid", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "id": "t221"}, {"type": "text", "x": 5900, "y": 1066, "width": 411, "height": 45.0, "strokeColor": "#3f3f46", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "text": "12. La meta se aprueba solo sobre tareas comparables.\n\n13. Un número que no se puede reproducir no es una medición.", "fontSize": 12, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 12, "containerId": null, "originalText": "12. La meta se aprueba solo sobre tareas comparables.\n\n13. Un número que no se puede reproducir no es una medición.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "seed": 1, "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "angle": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "fillStyle": "solid", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "id": "t222"}, {"type": "text", "x": 6180, "y": 1140, "width": 265, "height": 21.25, "strokeColor": "#868e96", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "text": "LIMA · EL CÍRCULO SE CIERRA", "fontSize": 17, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 17, "containerId": null, "originalText": "LIMA · EL CÍRCULO SE CIERRA", "lineHeight": 1.25, "seed": 1, "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "angle": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "fillStyle": "solid", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "id": "t223"}, {"type": "text", "x": 900, "y": 800, "width": 332, "height": 25.0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "text": "El cruce completo del Gateway", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 20, "containerId": null, "originalText": "El cruce completo del Gateway", "lineHeight": 1.25, "seed": 1, "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "angle": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "fillStyle": "solid", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "id": "t224"}, {"type": "text", "x": 900, "y": 830, "width": 476, "height": 13.75, "strokeColor": "#868e96", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "text": "2 × 2 × 2 × 2 = 16 filas. Están las 16; las ocho con A = no colapsan en una.", "fontSize": 11, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 11, "containerId": null, "originalText": "2 × 2 × 2 × 2 = 16 filas. Están las 16; las ocho con A = no colapsan en una.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "seed": 1, "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "angle": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "fillStyle": "solid", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "id": "t225"}, {"type": "text", "x": 900, "y": 866, "width": 392, "height": 137.5, "strokeColor": "#3f3f46", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "text": "campos  cache  presup.  red    CASO\n\n  no      -       -      -     FALTA DATO\n  si     si      si     si     REUSO\n  si     si      si     no     REUSO OFFLINE\n  si     si      no     si     REUSO SIN CUOTA\n  si     si      no     no     REUSO SIN CUOTA NI RED\n  si     no      si     si     GENERAR    <- el unico que cuesta\n  si     no      si     no     PENDIENTE DE RED\n  si     no      no     si     PRESUPUESTO EXCEDIDO\n  si     no      no     no     BLOQUEO SIN RED", "fontSize": 10, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 10, "containerId": null, "originalText": "campos  cache  presup.  red    CASO\n\n  no      -       -      -     FALTA DATO\n  si     si      si     si     REUSO\n  si     si      si     no     REUSO OFFLINE\n  si     si      no     si     REUSO SIN CUOTA\n  si     si      no     no     REUSO SIN CUOTA NI RED\n  si     no      si     si     GENERAR    <- el unico que cuesta\n  si     no      si     no     PENDIENTE DE RED\n  si     no      no     si     PRESUPUESTO EXCEDIDO\n  si     no      no     no     BLOQUEO SIN RED", "lineHeight": 1.25, "seed": 1, "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "angle": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "fillStyle": "solid", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "id": "t226"}, {"type": "text", "x": 900, "y": 1030, "width": 394, "height": 12.5, "strokeColor": "#3f3f46", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "text": "REUSO SIN CUOTA fija el orden: la caché va antes que el Budget Guard.", "fontSize": 10, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 10, "containerId": null, "originalText": "REUSO SIN CUOTA fija el orden: la caché va antes que el Budget Guard.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "seed": 1, "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "angle": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "fillStyle": "solid", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "id": "t227"}, {"type": "text", "x": 900, "y": 1062, "width": 400, "height": 25.0, "strokeColor": "#e8590c", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "text": "El acierto de caché sin red supone que la caché vive en el nodo local:\nsupuesto declarado, no dado por el enunciado.", "fontSize": 10, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 10, "containerId": null, "originalText": "El acierto de caché sin red supone que la caché vive en el nodo local:\nsupuesto declarado, no dado por el enunciado.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "seed": 1, "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "angle": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "fillStyle": "solid", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "id": "t228"}], "appState": {"gridSize": null, "viewBackgroundColor": "#ffffff"}, "files": {}}